<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Save</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>save</a>
</pre>
<p>Saves your character as it is, with everything you carry and wear. When you log 
on again, you are put in the room you were in when you were last saved.
</p><p>The game saves you by itself every 20 minutes, and when you quit, so you rarely 
need to type save; it is good to do after something you wouldn't like to lose, 
in case the game goes down. You must wait a minute between saves.
</p><p>A new character is a guest until it is saved for the first time, and a guest is 
forgotten when they quit. The first save, yours or the game's, makes you a real 
player: "You are no longer a guest on this game."
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Quit</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Equipment</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Score</a>
</pre>




</div>